00:02:05.614 --> 00:02:06.749
PICKING.

00:02:05.948 --> 00:02:08.284
&gt;&gt; THIS COULD IMPACT

00:02:06.882 --> 00:02:10.319
ANYTHING FROM MARIJUANA, GUN

00:02:08.417 --> 00:02:13.722
